## Real secrets must never be committed.
## appsettings.json is tracked and currently CONTAINS the JWT signing key, the
## PHI encryption key and the SMTP password. Those are in git history and must be
## treated as compromised and rotated. Until then, override them per environment
## with env vars (Jwt__Key, Encryption__Key) or one of the files below, which git
## will not pick up.
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Staging.json
ehr-system/appsettings.Production.json
ehr-system/appsettings.Staging.json

# Cookie jars written by ehr-system/scripts/verify-dme-foundation.sh
cookies.txt
restricted-cookies.txt

# Attached files when no cloud bucket is configured (LocalFileStorageService)
ehr-system/App_Data/storage/

# Verification-code emails written when Email:Enabled is false
emails_sent/
